{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:02 2026-09-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:02 2026-09-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:02 2026-09-03 HKT</p><p>葵涌有熟食市場發生火警。今日（3日）早上10時許，葵順街2號熟食市場一大排檔內，有員工開爐煮食時懷疑搶火，焫着爐具引起火災。警方及消防接獲多人報案趕到現場，消防員拖喉灌救，其後將火救熄。</p><p>現場消息稱，涉事大排檔員工當時炸排骨，其間疑搶火，焫着油煙喉並波及爐具。事後大排檔廚房熏黑，幸事件中無人受傷。</p><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救將火救息。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d2b8edc334202cfb5ee8768e08b0119b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_55_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0eea39c20e41d6ce5b6693f4adb0f1d8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大排檔煮食搶火，引起火災。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/921de1f3d7d372d4af8fca2d2ea2cf96/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_55.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b687d960b5b48eb8e5320aef71460dc7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_54_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8034e2d1ec7e25f40164a2e072ad1e8f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_53.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/80d1728265f42faee2e48a6671d02693/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_54_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f2883746d702e02d05cfd0b7a9e6e70d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_43_54.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T03:24:03.315727+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}